# The Supabase connection (project URL + public anon key) is baked into
# src/lib/supabase.ts — the lodge has one dedicated project, and the anon key is
# a public, RLS-protected client key. No frontend env vars are required to build
# or deploy.
#
# Optional, local dev only: set VITE_SUPABASE_URL to point the dev server's
# /file proxy at a different Supabase project.

# Server-side only: configure in Supabase Edge Function secrets (not in frontend env)
# GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=your-google-places-api-key
